      "provenance": "Unverified missing-module reconstruction; adapted intact Boost binding 55e6516eb91b739e899df1ef8d72116da44fec49:GameScript.cpp to original #260-268 no-argument callbacks and CMap/CMapObject/CBuilding/CItem/CInteraction/CTile/CScriptEngine APIs; Creature/Player/Monster API from intact #247 headers with source-era C-prefix renames; Stats/Damage typed-property API from intact #257 Stats.h/cpp. Preserves Python2.7 BOOST_PYTHON_MODULE(_game) -> init_game; UTF8 QString conversion supports Python2 str/unicode. CPotion wrapper deduces the native void/bool onUse return type across original #266 transition and always calls the real fallback.",
      "sha256": "c44ad3ff332fb217d7362175b851d0e4e4e58c7f1f4ea0eea669838d8b35413e",
