  "limitations": [
    "No compilation or runtime acceptance: pinned toolchain and remaining native reconstructions are required.",
    "Original CCreature.h is missing throughout these trees and must be restored separately; no fake definitions are supplied.",
    "Earlier six distinct GameScript original blobs at #246-259 still require their own source-era API adaptations.",
    "Binding API equivalence is bounded by surviving header/caller evidence; containers, GUI panels, and later-only quest/event/trade APIs are not invented.",
    "CTile::onStep is nonvirtual in original headers and is exposed directly without a fake Python override.",
